 be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, and simple game rules, suitable for everyone!\nIt\u2019s transformed from the traditional matching game and brings a relaxing experience to players in a 3D way.\nBe the master and pair all the cubes to eliminate them on over 30 levels!\n\nGame features:\n\n- 60 levels\n- Mixed reality support\n- 5 Relaxing environment with daytime and night mode, plus a random option.\n- 8 Tile set\n- Classic and 3D style levels.\n- English, Hungarian and Simplified Chinese languages.\n- Rotate, move and zoom the board.\n\n\n{808240775651188}", "short_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels and simple game rules!\n5 relaxing environments, 8 various colourful tile sets,60 levels and night mode! Mixed Reality support"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo2-chinese.png", "id": "1628457724592817", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75568725_1628457727926150_374747833840138475_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L-xoSf19AYgQ7kNvwGsBXQL&_nc_oc=AdrlAbl2Bol-0rMSVjxsTyR-MVrcuNG6URkiaPZR0cXs8uWhhzXJOGz9o-ZWUFfZFKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3z0UO4L7tADg98oO31qYZWjmlu-O6yyNXFQvkmOznfrw&oe=69F0A740"}, {"file_name": "landscapefull-chinese.png", "id": "1452552865375930", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210891_1452552868709263_7671164401111142330_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NNcc1cOZY5IQ7kNvwGJ7xRD&_nc_oc=AdoQqaUPDxpqrEg9j5Mf6Bry-zsLmwOju05eBdJK8mPWBu8O_QWDawJfcbrGClUXSiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af01UR87rZ_lC6QQ0yY2xdlj4Jri28xMDMClBA6FPtJ16A&oe=69F0D02B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1151590899619147", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031429_1151590902952480_1438806